cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TID-CMM — Threat-Informed Detection Capability Maturity Model"
message: "If you use this model, its datasets or its tooling, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Adineh
    given-names: Reza
    website: "https://rezaadineh.info"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ReZaAdineH/tid-cmm"
url: "https://tid-cmm.com"
abstract: >-
  An open capability maturity model for threat-informed detection. Eight domains and 58
  sub-capabilities scored 0-5, anchored to MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise. Derives an in-scope
  technique set from environment, prioritised threat actors and attack paths, then computes
  which of those behaviours an organisation is structurally unable to detect with the
  telemetry it collects. Four integrity constraints prevent capability being claimed
  without evidence.
keywords:
  - detection engineering
  - threat detection
  - MITRE ATT&CK
  - maturity model
  - security operations
  - threat-informed defence
  - telemetry coverage
  - purple team
